{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2f59455d-4759-476c-ae25-0f745368dc35",
    "name": "Sanos y Salvos — User + Pet + Report + Media + Integration",
    "description": "**Docker Compose (variables por defecto):** user **9081**, report **9082**, pet **9083**, media **9084**, integration **9085**. MinIO **9000**.\n\n**IDE / JVM local:** `baseUrlUser`→8081, `baseUrlReport`→8082, `baseUrlPet`→8083, `baseUrlMedia`→8084, `baseUrlIntegration`→8085.\n\n**ORDEN típico:** 1) Login → 2) POST pet → 3) POST report (Bearer) → 4) Media upload → POST media del reporte.\n\n**Integration:** cabecera **`X-Api-Key`** (variable `integrationApiKey`). La clave debe existir en la BD (`msvc-integration`); si no, **401**.\n\n**msvc-report:** carpeta *msvc-report* con `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\n\n**Feign:** pet→User; report→Pet+User; internal/activity→Pet+Report.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "43149860"
  },
